    "body": "> > In Blink, we decided to make alert/confirm/prompt not spin a modal message loop.\n> \n> You mean inside a microtask, or in general? What does it do instead?\n\nIn general. We block the entire app instead. In Blink, those dialogs are app-modal anyways. Previously, we had a nested message loop to continue rendering animations, but now they just pause.\n\n> > We'll block SyncXHR\n> \n> As in throw from send()?\n\nYes\n",
